# game/ch10.rpy:15
translate english ch10_42bccf0b:

    # n "周六下午，阿狐在游戏里认识了一位「同班玩家」，对方昵称「小雨」，说自己也是小学生，玩同一款游戏。"
    n "Saturday afternoon. In the game, Ahu met a \"classmate player\" nicknamed \"Xiaoyu\", who said she was also an elementary schooler playing the same game."

# game/ch10.rpy:16
translate english ch10_4458f24c:

    # n "几天聊下来，两人组队越来越默契，「小雨」还主动分享了动画、聊学校趣事，阿狐把她当成了好朋友。"
    n "After days of chatting, they teamed up better and better. \"Xiaoyu\" shared anime and school stories, and Ahu came to see her as a good friend."

# game/ch10.rpy:17
translate english ch10_a614cd50:

    # xiaoyu laugh "阿狐，我们互换一张照片吧，看看对方长什么样呀！我先发我的，你也要发哦！"
    xiaoyu laugh "Ahu, let's swap photos and see what we look like! I'll send mine first — you send yours too!"

# game/ch10.rpy:18
translate english ch10_d477cc2b:

    # n "对方发来一张小女孩的照片，看起来活泼可爱。"
    n "The other side sent a photo of a young girl — lively and cute."

# game/ch10.rpy:19
translate english ch10_578c3958:

    # think normal "聊了这么久，交换张照片也正常吧……"
    think normal "We've chatted so long — swapping photos is normal enough..."

# game/ch10.rpy:22
translate english ch10_45c59e2f:

    # xiaoyu laugh "照片太模糊啦！你发一张穿着睡衣、光着膀子的，我们才是真正的好朋友嘛，我都发过了，你怕什么呀！"
    xiaoyu laugh "That photo's too blurry! Send one in your pajamas, bare-chested — that's what real friends do. I already sent mine. What are you afraid of?"

# game/ch10.rpy:36
translate english ch10_A_0d3f91f8:

    # n "「光膀子的照片」这个要求让阿狐心里咯噔一下。"
    n "The request for a \"bare-chested photo\" made Ahu's heart skip."

# game/ch10.rpy:37
translate english ch10_A_82a4cb61:

    # think serious "老师讲过：身体的隐私部位不能给任何人看、不能拍照，网上「朋友」要这种照片，绝对不正常！"
    think serious "Teacher taught us: private parts of your body must never be shown to or photographed by anyone. An online \"friend\" asking for such photos is absolutely not normal!"

# game/ch10.rpy:38
translate english ch10_A_c53c9b77:

    # mc serious "这种照片我不能发，谁要都不能发！"
    mc serious "I can't send that kind of photo — not to anyone, no matter who asks!"

# game/ch10.rpy:39
translate english ch10_A_35c6c9fc:

    # n "阿狐立刻退出游戏，把聊天记录截图给妈妈看。妈妈表扬了他，陪他举报拉黑了账号，并向游戏平台申诉。"
    n "Ahu left the game at once and showed Mom the chat screenshots. She praised him, helped him report and block the account, and appealed to the game platform."

# game/ch10.rpy:40
translate english ch10_A_8f673a81:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这种「套照片」的账号背后往往是成年人骗子！你做得完全正确，隐私照片一张都不能发！"
    mom serious "Sweetie, behind accounts that \"collect photos\" there are often adult scammers! You did exactly right — not one private photo, ever!"

# game/ch10.rpy:43
translate english ch10_A_c8444aa0:

    # police laugh "警惕性满分！索要私密照片的都是坏人，不管他说得多好听、是不是「同龄人」。不发、不拍、马上告诉家长，你就是最安全的孩子！"
    police laugh "Full marks for vigilance! Anyone asking for private photos is a bad person — no matter how nice they sound or how \"same-aged\" they claim to be. Don't send, don't shoot, tell your parents right away — that's how you stay safest!"

# game/ch10.rpy:55
translate english ch10_B_13d5d711:

    # mc confused "为什么要这种照片呀？普通合照不行吗？"
    mc confused "Why that kind of photo? Can't we just swap normal ones?"

# game/ch10.rpy:56
translate english ch10_B_3f17bb15:

    # xiaoyu serious "你不发就是不喜欢我这个朋友！班里的同学都互相发过，就你磨磨唧唧的。"
    xiaoyu serious "If you won't send it, you don't like me as a friend! Everyone in class sends these to each other — only you keep stalling."

# game/ch10.rpy:57
translate english ch10_B_303c446a:

    # xiaoyu laugh "快发一张，发完我把我珍藏的皮肤账号送你玩！"
    xiaoyu laugh "Hurry and send one, and I'll let you play with my treasured skin account!"

# game/ch10.rpy:58
translate english ch10_B_b9b2b52b:

    # n "对方一边用「友情」绑架，一边用「游戏账号」做诱饵，不断催促。"
    n "The scammer used \"friendship\" as leverage and a \"game account\" as bait, pushing nonstop."

# game/ch10.rpy:72
translate english ch10_B1_79e93270:

    # n "阿狐退出游戏，拿着平板走到客厅找妈妈。"
    n "Ahu left the game and carried his tablet to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch10.rpy:73
translate english ch10_B1_0519f14e:

    # think worried "她平时聊得挺好的，可这个要求太奇怪了……还是先问问妈妈。"
    think worried "She's usually nice to chat with, but this request is too weird... Ask Mom first."

# game/ch10.rpy:74
translate english ch10_B1_014ad34c:

    # mc worried "妈妈，游戏里认识的「同学」让我发穿睡衣的照片，还说不发就不是好朋友，我该怎么办？"
    mc worried "Mom, a \"classmate\" I met in a game wants photos of me in pajamas and says we won't be friends otherwise. What should I do?"

# game/ch10.rpy:75
translate english ch10_B1_5deb1e81:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「套私密照」的骗局！真正的朋友不会用绝交逼你拍隐私照片。这类照片一旦发出去，就可能被坏人拿去威胁你。你不发，就是最对的！"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is a \"private photo trap\"! A real friend never forces you to shoot private photos with threats of ending the friendship. Once such photos are out, bad people can use them to threaten you. Not sending them is exactly right!"

# game/ch10.rpy:76
translate english ch10_B1_7ee28fb5:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报拉黑了账号，并把游戏的好友申请设置成了「仅限现实好友」。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report and block the account, and set the game's friend requests to \"real-life friends only\"."

# game/ch10.rpy:79
translate english ch10_B1_3c638bae:

    # police laugh "做得棒！用「绝交」「礼物」逼你发隐私照片的，不管是谁，都是坏人。守住底线，马上告诉家长，你做得非常好！"
    police laugh "Well done! Whoever pushes you to send private photos with \"breakup threats\" or \"gifts\" is a bad person. Hold the line and tell your parents right away — you did wonderfully!"

# game/ch10.rpy:91
translate english ch10_B2_55780e47:

    # mc serious "这种照片我绝不发。你不是我朋友，朋友不会逼我做这种事！"
    mc serious "I will never send that. You're not my friend — friends don't force each other to do this!"

# game/ch10.rpy:92
translate english ch10_B2_11a8483a:

    # xiaoyu serious "行啊你！等着，我有的是办法让你后悔！"
    xiaoyu serious "Big of you! Just wait — I have plenty of ways to make you regret this!"

# game/ch10.rpy:93
translate english ch10_B2_e78ade43:

    # n "阿狐没有被吓住，果断删除好友、退出游戏。当晚他把这件事告诉了妈妈，妈妈帮他检查了账号隐私设置，并肯定了他的做法。"
    n "Ahu wasn't intimidated — he deleted the friend and left the game. That evening he told Mom; she checked his privacy settings and affirmed what he did."

# game/ch10.rpy:96
translate english ch10_B2_13e5e4c2:

    # police serious "拒绝得干脆，做得对！不过下次记住：遇到这种骚扰，第一时间告诉家长和老师，让大人帮你处理，比你一个人硬扛更稳妥。"
    police serious "Clean refusal — well done! But next time remember: when harassed like this, tell parents and teachers first. Letting adults handle it beats toughing it out alone."

# game/ch10.rpy:108
translate english ch10_B3_9d7289ce:

    # n "阿狐不好意思拒绝，发了一张穿校服的普通生活照过去。"
    n "Too awkward to refuse, Ahu sent an ordinary photo of himself in his school uniform."

# game/ch10.rpy:109
translate english ch10_B3_ea7b2890:

    # n "对方却立刻变本加厉：要求拍更私密的部位，「不拍就把照片发给全校同学，说你是个坏孩子」。"
    n "The scammer immediately escalated: shoot more private parts, \"or I'll send this photo to your whole school and tell everyone you're a bad kid\"."

# game/ch10.rpy:110
translate english ch10_B3_8dd059e3:

    # xiaoyu serious "快点拍！不然你这张照片加上编好的「坏话」，马上出现在你们班级群里！"
    xiaoyu serious "Shoot it now! Or this photo, with made-up \"dirt\" attached, lands in your class group right away!"

# game/ch10.rpy:111
translate english ch10_B3_895998cb:

    # think serious "她开始威胁我了！老师说过的「套照片骗局」是真的！"
    think serious "She's threatening me now! The \"photo trap\" teacher warned about is real!"

# game/ch10.rpy:112
translate english ch10_B3_23b6c118:

    # mc serious "我不怕你！我要把聊天记录全部告诉老师和妈妈！"
    mc serious "I'm not scared of you! I'm showing every bit of this chat to my teacher and my mom!"

# game/ch10.rpy:113
translate english ch10_B3_ca76932b:

    # n "阿狐马上截图告诉了妈妈和班主任。老师上报学校并协助报警，骗子账号被封禁。"
    n "Ahu screenshot-reported it to Mom and his head teacher right away. The teacher escalated to the school and helped report to the police — the scammer's account was banned."

# game/ch10.rpy:116
translate english ch10_B3_9a449b5a:

    # police serious "照片已经泄露，但你的处理非常正确：不害怕、不妥协、马上告诉大人！记住，被威胁时，老师和警察永远是你的后盾。"
    police serious "The photo leaked, but your response was exactly right: no fear, no compromise, tell adults immediately! Remember: when threatened, teachers and police always have your back."

# game/ch10.rpy:128
translate english ch10_C_d6c82b4b:

    # n "阿狐怕失去这个「好朋友」，真的拍了照片发了过去。"
    n "Afraid of losing this \"good friend\", Ahu really did take and send the photo."

# game/ch10.rpy:129
translate english ch10_C_991546e3:

    # think laugh "她都先发我了，我应该讲义气……"
    think laugh "She sent hers first — I should be loyal..."

# game/ch10.rpy:130
translate english ch10_C_206f8da1:

    # xiaoyu laugh "乖~ 再拍一张更隐私的，我就把皮肤账号给你！"
    xiaoyu laugh "Good boy~ one more, more private, and the skin account is yours!"

# game/ch10.rpy:131
translate english ch10_C_4f141b7b:

    # n "阿狐犹豫着又拍了一张。就在发送成功的下一秒，对方的头像和昵称突然全变了。"
    n "Hesitating, Ahu took another. The second after it sent, the other side's avatar and nickname suddenly changed."

# game/ch10.rpy:132
translate english ch10_C_7dc5053a:

    # xiaoyu serious "小子，看清楚了吧？你刚才的照片都在我手里。给我转5000元，不然我把照片发到你们学校贴吧和班级群，让你没法做人！"
    xiaoyu serious "Kid, see that? Your photos are in my hands now. Transfer me 5,000 yuan, or these go to your school forum and class group — see how you live that down!"

# game/ch10.rpy:146
translate english ch10_C1_aae2d67c:

    # n "阿狐吓得不轻，但他死死记住了一条底线。"
    n "Ahu was badly frightened, but one bottom line was burned into his memory."

# game/ch10.rpy:147
translate english ch10_C1_d582f170:

    # think serious "老师说过：就算照片被坏人拿到，错的也是坏人，绝不能乖乖转钱！这种事第一时间告诉爸妈，永远不会错！"
    think serious "Teacher said: even if bad people get your photo, THEY are at fault — never meekly pay! Telling your parents first is always right!"

# game/ch10.rpy:148
translate english ch10_C1_858bb552:

    # mc serious "照片你可以随便发，钱我一分不会给。我现在就把所有聊天记录交给警察！"
    mc serious "Send the photos if you want — you won't get one cent. I'm handing every chat record to the police right now!"

# game/ch10.rpy:149
translate english ch10_C1_d0156ecc:

    # n "阿狐立刻冲到客厅，把经过一五一十告诉妈妈。妈妈没有责备他，马上报警，并保留了全部聊天证据。"
    n "Ahu rushed to the living room and told Mom everything. She didn't blame him — she called the police at once and preserved all the chat evidence."

# game/ch10.rpy:150
translate english ch10_C1_8f15fe60:

    # n "民警很快锁定了账号，骗子见阿狐家报了警，账号连夜注销，再也没敢出现。"
    n "Officers quickly traced the account. Seeing the police were involved, the scammer deleted the account overnight and never dared return."

# game/ch10.rpy:151
translate english ch10_C1_a11aa9fd:

    # mom laugh "你今天比大人还勇敢！记住：无论发生什么，爸妈永远是你的靠山。"
    mom laugh "Today you were braver than most grown-ups! Remember: whatever happens, Mom and Dad are always your rock."

# game/ch10.rpy:154
translate english ch10_C1_2facb0bb:

    # police serious "处理堪称教科书！遇到「私密照勒索」：不转钱、不删证据、立刻报告家长和警察。记住：被威胁不是你的错，妥协才会让坏人得寸进尺！"
    police serious "A textbook response! Facing \"private photo extortion\": don't pay, don't delete evidence, report to parents and police immediately. Remember: being threatened is never your fault — only giving in makes bullies bolder!"

# game/ch10.rpy:166
translate english ch10_C2_d4d84255:

    # n "阿狐把攒了一年的500元零花钱转了过去，求对方删照片。"
    n "Ahu transferred the 500 yuan he'd saved all year, begging the scammer to delete the photos."

# game/ch10.rpy:167
translate english ch10_C2_30a76951:

    # think laugh "给了钱，他就应该把照片删了吧……"
    think laugh "Once I pay, he'll delete the photos... right?"

# game/ch10.rpy:168
translate english ch10_C2_1af33d01:

    # xiaoyu serious "500就想打发我？你父母是开公司的吧？再转3000，不然照片立刻发出！"
    xiaoyu serious "500 to make me go away? Your parents run a business, don't they? Send 3,000 more or the photos go out now!"

# game/ch10.rpy:169
translate english ch10_C2_1ad751d5:

    # mc confused "说好给钱就删照片的，怎么又要更多？"
    mc confused "We agreed — money for deletion. Why demand more?"

# game/ch10.rpy:170
translate english ch10_C2_7889d5ae:

    # n "阿狐终于崩溃，哭着把一切告诉了妈妈。妈妈立刻报警——但转出去的500元，早被骗子转移了。"
    n "Ahu finally broke down and told Mom everything through tears. She reported to the police at once — but the 500 yuan had long been moved by the scammer."

# game/ch10.rpy:173
translate english ch10_C2_34ada9df:

    # police serious "记住：给勒索者转钱，就像往无底洞里填土，永远不会填满。被骗照片威胁，唯一正确的做法就是：不转钱、留证据、报告家长和警察！"
    police serious "Remember: paying a blackmailer is like filling a bottomless pit with dirt — it never fills up. Threatened over photos? The only correct move: don't pay, keep evidence, report to parents and police!"

# game/ch10.rpy:185
translate english ch10_C3_33fefa59:

    # n "阿狐太害怕了，不敢告诉任何人，把零花钱1000元全部转了过去。"
    n "Too terrified to tell anyone, Ahu transferred his entire 1,000 yuan of allowance."

# game/ch10.rpy:186
translate english ch10_C3_0f27a07b:

    # n "对方收了钱，不但没删照片，反而变本加厉，隔三差五发消息威胁：「再转2000，不然全班都看到。」"
    n "The scammer took the money, deleted nothing, and escalated — messaging threats every few days: \"2,000 more, or the whole class sees.\""

# game/ch10.rpy:187
translate english ch10_C3_ff536634:

    # n "阿狐吃不下饭、睡不着觉，成绩一落千丈，天天提心吊胆。一个月后，班主任发现他情绪异常，耐心询问下，他才哭着说出实情。"
    n "Ahu couldn't eat or sleep, his grades plummeted, and he lived in constant fear. A month later, his head teacher noticed something wrong and, with patient questions, finally got the truth out of him in tears."

# game/ch10.rpy:188
translate english ch10_C3_c825b767:

    # n "老师和家长立刻报警，骗子落网了——但已转走的一千多元，只追回了一小部分。"
    n "The teacher and parents reported to the police immediately, and the scammer was caught — but only a small part of the stolen 1,000-plus yuan was recovered."

# game/ch10.rpy:189
translate english ch10_C3_a839a7d9:

    # mc sad "我应该一开始就告诉爸妈的……一个人扛，越扛越糟……"
    mc sad "I should have told Mom and Dad from the start... carrying it alone only made it worse..."

# game/ch10.rpy:192
translate english ch10_C3_52586825:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！私密照被勒索，瞒着大人是最大的错误。你越害怕、越妥协，坏人越嚣张。第一时间告诉爸妈和警察，天塌不下来，大人一定能帮你！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! With private-photo extortion, hiding it from adults is the biggest mistake. The more scared and compliant you are, the bolder the crook. Tell your parents and the police immediately — the sky won't fall, and adults WILL help you!"

